description=Gamepad handling fixes: steering and triggers without dead zones, analog gas and brake (light press = slow steady speed, optional brake hold without backing up), speed-sensitive steering without lag, UI presses no longer leak to the character, controller presets save in any language (Linux), crouch/sprint toggles on press, smooth analog map panning and zoom, rebindable hardcoded buttons (D-pad wheels, Back, Start, cruise speed, L3 radial, UI navigation), cruise control and reload follow their bindings, keyboard-only actions and the firearm menu (light, drop, horn, engine, hotbar, windows, game speed...) for the controller, inventory window actions (transfer/loot all, same type, all to floor, drop, whole stack / one item, use, unpack), all assignable in Options -> Controller (per preset) and as Steam Input game actions (back paddles, long press, chords), vanilla bindings (crouch, interact, aim, attack, shove, run...) as Steam actions too, camera pan while aiming (movable off RB), driver's seat, curtains, fire mode, tool on the square ahead, rotate building, voice push-to-talk, gyro / trackpad aiming through a Steam analog action (also with the trigger alone), per-player Steam actions in splitscreen (Linux and Windows). Every feature can be turned off or tuned in Options -> Mods.
